<title>HONG KONG: Bear Stearns sets warrants on CITIC.</title>
<headline>Bear Stearns sets warrants on CITIC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns Companies Inc said on Tuesday it intended to issue 100 million American-style call warrants, subject to increase, on shares of CITIC Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$37.81	PREMIUM	 12.55 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.6985     GEARING	 5.70X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   04.DEC.97     MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG     LISTING DATE  06.MAR.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE     HK$39.80</p>
<p>SPONSOR &amp; SALES AGENT  BEAR STEARNS ASIA LTD</p>
<p>NOTE: PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
